WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.980
So for Space Force.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:03.813
[Conan] Yes.

00:00:03.813 --> 00:00:07.023
We did this game night thing.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.150
And most of the cast of
Space Force was there.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.770
And I was winning.

00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:16.000
It was tied between me and Steve Carell.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.667
And what we had to do
was go into our house

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.120
and find some novelty mug,

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.355
and then that would decide who won.

00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:24.188
[Conan] Yeah?

00:00:24.188 --> 00:00:25.021
So he went,

00:00:25.021 --> 00:00:27.600
and first thing I could
think of Conan, was this.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.082
Does this look familiar to you?

00:00:29.082 --> 00:00:30.214
Yes!

00:00:30.214 --> 00:00:31.047
Right?

00:00:31.047 --> 00:00:31.880
I do remember that.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:32.713
Yes.

00:00:32.713 --> 00:00:33.546
Right?

00:00:33.546 --> 00:00:34.800
And so I don't even.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.890
I was so happy and I just said, this!

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.470
This is from Conan's
first year on Late Night

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:42.780
and there wasn't even,

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.230
it didn't even say Late
Night with Conan O'Brien.

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:46.480
And I still have it.
[Conan] Right.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:47.313
And this is it.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:48.313
But is that right?

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:49.983
Yeah.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:50.996
I think so.

00:00:50.996 --> 00:00:53.890
I think we, early on, they
weren't sure I was gonna make it,

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:56.920
so they didn't wanna put
my name on any of the mugs.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.460
They just wanted if another host took over

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:02.072
they wanted to just be
able to use the same mugs.

00:01:02.072 --> 00:01:03.080
(Lisa laughs)

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.640
So yes, you're right.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.720
I think that's from the first season

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:10.040
when pre putting my name on anything.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.670
And so did you win because of that?

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:13.503
Yes!

00:01:13.503 --> 00:01:17.700
Because it was TV history.
Yes!

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:22.100
Like they all viewed it as,
okay that is TV history.

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:24.860
That's monumental.

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:26.405
Yes.

00:01:26.405 --> 00:01:29.200
But then I woke up in
the middle of the night

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.490
and I thought, wait, I
wasn't on Conan's show

00:01:32.490 --> 00:01:33.860
his first year.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.684
But I think you got a mug.

00:01:35.684 --> 00:01:37.180
How?

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.400
I don't know, I think we were friends

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:42.710
and you visited and I think you took one.

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:43.715
[Lisa] I just took one.

00:01:43.715 --> 00:01:45.890
Remember when you used to,

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:46.960
I don't know if you want this out or not,

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.244
but you used to steal
things, take things a lot.

00:01:49.244 --> 00:01:50.077
Well.

00:01:51.363 --> 00:01:52.196
Remember?

00:01:52.196 --> 00:01:53.373
Let me rephrase that.

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:56.659
In the 90s, you stole things.

00:01:56.659 --> 00:01:59.380
Oh better thanks.

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:02.080
After the first year my
name started to go on stuff.

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:04.430
Then starting about a
year ago they started

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:06.347
taking it off stuff again.

00:02:06.347 --> 00:02:08.040
(both laugh)

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.980
It must be fun getting to work with,

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.010
I mean it's a great cast, Space Force

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:12.870
and you're working

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:15.360
with my old writing partner, Greg Daniels.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.580
Yeah, how about that?

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:17.963
This must be, yeah.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:22.913
We used to all hang out in
the day, back long time ago.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.330
Greg Daniels was my writing partner

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:30.360
and this was back when I think you knew me

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:32.231
Greg and I shared--

00:02:32.231 --> 00:02:33.530
Everything.

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:35.403
We shared a car.

00:02:35.403 --> 00:02:36.236
(Lisa laughs)

00:02:36.236 --> 00:02:39.320
So if one of us got a date,
we had to ask the other one

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:40.600
to borrow the car.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:42.053
We shared an apartment.

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.200
We had desks that faced
each other at work.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.820
And I think after a year and a half

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:49.614
we wanted to kill each other.

00:02:49.614 --> 00:02:52.314
(laughs) We absolutely
wanted to kill each other.

00:02:52.314 --> 00:02:54.770
It was sort of preparation for right now.

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:56.680
Yes, that was our preparation

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:58.180
for this time we're going through.

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:01.580
You were quarantined
after college together.

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:03.997
(both laugh)

